content:
        请审查以下内容并提供改进建议:
        类型: 
        general

        执行计划: 

{
    "plan": [
        {
            "step": 1,
            "action": "ingest_file",
            "args": {
                "file_path": "data/contracts/sample_contract.pdf"
            }
        },
        {
            "step": 2,
            "action": "ingest_file",
            "args": {
                "file_path": "data/criteria/standard_criteria.json"
            }
        },
        {
            "step": 3,
            "action": "summarize_contract",
            "args": {
                "contract_content": "{{ingest_file.content[0].text}}"
            }
        },
        {
            "step": 4,
            "action": "extract_clauses",
            "args": {
                "contract_content": "{{ingest_file.content[0].text}}",
                "clauses": [
                    "Payment Terms",
                    "Termination Clause",
                    "Intellectual Property"
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "step": 5,
            "action": "evaluate_clauses",
            "args": {
                "contract_content": "{{ingest_file.content[0].text}}",
                "clauses": "{{extract_clauses.content[0].text}}",
                "criteria": "{{ingest_file.content[0].text}}"
            }
        },
        {
            "step": 6,
            "action": "generate_report",
            "args": {
                "contract_content": "{{ingest_file.content[0].text}}",
                "clauses": "{{extract_clauses.content[0].text}}",
                "evaluation": "{{evaluate_clauses.content[0].text}}"
            }
        }
    ]
}


        审核标准：
        None

        请按JSON格式输出：
        {'status': 'PASS/REJECT', 'feedback': '...'}
